@startuml AD-6_pillar_started_session
!include _style.iuml
title AD-6 Session Started at the Pillar (card, password or free vend) and Classified\n<size:11>Scope: PowerMe «software system» · Trigger: driver taps a card, enters the pillar password or plugs in · v2.0 (ADR-0015: no reservation path; ends in STM-1 states)</size>

|Driver\n«person»|
|#EEEEEE|Charging Pillar\n«external system»|
|PowerMe Platform\n«software system»|
|Driver\n«person»|
start
:Tap card, enter pillar password\nor plug in (free vend);
|#EEEEEE|Charging Pillar\n«external system»|
if ( ) then ([online card])
  :Ask platform to\nauthorise card; <<output>>
  |PowerMe Platform\n«software system»|
  if ( ) then ([card unknown, unlinked or blocked,\nor credit < start minimum])
    :Refuse card; <<output>>
    |#EEEEEE|Charging Pillar\n«external system»|
    :Show refusal on pillar screen;
    stop
  else ([linked driver with enough credit])
    |PowerMe Platform\n«software system»|
    :Accept card; <<output>>
  endif
else ([wallet card, password or free vend])
  |#EEEEEE|Charging Pillar\n«external system»|
  :Authorise locally;
endif
|#EEEEEE|Charging Pillar\n«external system»|
:Start energy delivery and\nreport session start;
|PowerMe Platform\n«software system»|
:Record session (never dropped)\nand look up its card tag;
switch ( )
case ([online card of a driver])
  :Classify csms_billed;
case ([wallet card])
  :Classify station_wallet;
case ([free-vend tag or unknown tag])
  :Classify free / unattributed;
endswitch
:ChargingSession\n[active]; <<task>>
:Monitor until the pillar\nreports the session end (AD-1);
:ChargingSession\n[closed]; <<task>>
if ( ) then ([csms_billed])
  :Price, debit Charging Credit,\naward points, send statement;
else ([station_wallet or free])
  :Price for reconciliation only;\nno debit, no invoice (ADR-0012);
endif
:ChargingSession\n[reconciled]; <<task>>
stop
!include _legend.iuml
@enduml
